    "created_at": "2023-09-11T17:56:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-11T17:59:35Z",
    "body": "> > The bMaxPacketSize field reports the maximum packet size for endpoint zero. All devices must support endpoint zero.\r\n\r\nI suspect that definition is somewhat outdated. It was true for older versions of USB, but not for USB 3.0 / SuperSpeed I think. I need to find a better reference link though.",
